        {
          "id": "d18-s8-outlook",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "For Q2 2025 the plan assumes continued margin expansion as the pricing changes flow through renewals. The board approved a capital expenditure budget of $16.6M for Q2 2025, weighted towards fleet renewal.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 97.4
          },
          "width": 166
